{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33597","headline":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 六 · 许棠","name":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东来淮海拜旌旟，不把公卿一字书。\n曾侍晚斋吟对雪，又容华馆食兼鱼。\n孤微自省恩非次，际会谁知分有余。\n唯耻旧桥题处在，荣归无计似相如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}